IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-APRIORI-ROUTER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 QUERY-LEN           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CACHE-HIT-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-APRIORI-ROUTER.
    IF QUERY-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 618200 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    MOVE 4800 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    MOVE 100 TO CACHE-HIT-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 QUERY-LEN.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
